  "question": "Does the BikerBed fit a Renault Trafic?"
}

{
  "answerable": false,
  "answer": "I'm afraid I can't confirm whether the BikerBed fits a Renault Trafic. It was designed for the short-wheelbase VW Transporter (T5/T6) and also fits some long-wheelbase vans and other makes, including Ford Transits, but the Trafic isn't specifically mentioned. What I can tell you is that it needs your van's factory (OEM) cargo tie-down points, and the bed is up to 1950mm long, so the load space needs to be long enough for that. To check before you order, please email support@neonomad.co.uk with your van's details.",
